{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日\nというか、もうすぐ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タマフルに出演させていただきます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2回目だよ～！めっちゃ楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/19/6015158/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/19/6015158/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22時から TBSラジオ\n「ライムスター宇多丸のウィークエンド・シャッフル」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は沈金でした～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは\nOfficial髭男 dismさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おざささんとふじはらさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平子さんも言ってたけど\n名前とイメージが全然違って\n爽やかでびっくりしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/19/6015158/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださってありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隠語はまじで隠語でした！\n意味がわからないもの多々！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくださったみなさん\nありがと～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらに遡って\n一昨日の\n『Rの法則』観てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送終わりのみり愛ちゃんが教えてくれたけど\nバトントワリングが1位になったみたいで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/19/6015158/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってた頃が7年前で\n本当に久々にさわるから\nスタジオを取ってもらって練習したんだけど\n全然、数日じゃ戻らなくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、昔に乃木どこで披露したときよりも\n技を多くいれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5年前より度胸がついたのかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n乃木團も披露させてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃめちゃ緊張したけど\nやってて楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/19/6015158/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと上手くなりたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと継続しなきゃですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/19/6015158/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}